{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2SA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒母耳記下","commonName":"撒母耳記下","title":"撒母耳記下","order":10,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"5df878ca1e611ddbd4ba76c8d97fced0bcbe1bc75485d9075195fb8f379fad76","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2SA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2SA/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":689},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大衛得知掃羅的死訊"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大衛戰勝了亞瑪力人之後便回到洗革拉，在那裡住了兩天。那時掃羅已經死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["第三天，有一個衣服撕裂、頭蒙灰塵的人從掃羅軍營中跑到大衛面前，俯伏下拜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大衛問他：「你從哪裡來？」那人答道：「我是從以色列軍營逃出來的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["大衛說：「請告訴我那邊的情況。」他說：「以色列軍潰逃，傷亡慘重，就連掃羅和他兒子約拿單都死了！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大衛又問報信的青年：「你怎麼知道掃羅和他兒子約拿單死了？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["青年說：「我偶然到基利波山，看見掃羅在那裡倚槍而立，敵人的戰車騎兵緊緊追來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他回頭看到我，便呼喚我。我說，『我在這裡。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他問我是什麼人。我告訴他我是亞瑪力人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["掃羅說他痛苦不堪，卻又死不掉，要我殺了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我知道他身受重傷，必死無疑，就把他殺了，並取下他頭上的王冠和臂上的鐲子帶來獻給我主。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["大衛就撕裂衣服，他的隨從也撕裂衣服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們因掃羅、他的兒子約拿單和耶和華的子民以色列同胞陣亡而悲哀痛哭，禁食直到黃昏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["大衛又問報信的青年：「你是哪裡的人？」他答道：「我是寄居在以色列的亞瑪力人。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["大衛說：「你怎麼敢下手殺耶和華所膏立的王？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你是咎由自取！因為你親口承認自己殺了耶和華所膏立的王。」大衛隨即命令一個年輕的隨從殺死他，隨從便殺死了他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["大衛的哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["大衛作了一首輓歌哀悼掃羅和他兒子約拿單，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["並吩咐人教導猶大人唱這首弓歌。這首歌記在《雅煞珥書》上，歌詞說："]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你榮耀的王伏屍山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士竟然倒下！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在迦特宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在亞實基倫的街上傳揚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得非利士的婦女幸災樂禍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得未受割禮之人的女子歡喜雀躍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"「基利波山啊，願你沒有雨露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的田地不長獻祭用的五穀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為那裡有勇士鏽污的盾牌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掃羅的盾牌沒有抹油。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"「約拿單的弓射敵無數，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掃羅的劍不殺強敵不收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"「掃羅和約拿單深受愛戴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生死不分離。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們比鷹更敏捷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比獅子還強壯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"「以色列的女子啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為掃羅哀哭吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他曾使你們衣服華美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿金戴銀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"「勇士竟戰死沙場！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"約拿單竟伏屍山上！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的兄弟約拿單啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為你悲傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你對我情深義重，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你對我的愛勝過女人的戀情。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"「勇士竟然倒下！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兵器竟然耗損！」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2SA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2SA/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1SA/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}